0	section	Using evidence other than the fingernails on the Watchtower Wizard
1	line	Watchtower Wizard	Let me see...
1	line	Watchtower Wizard	No, sorry, this is not evidence. You need to keep searching, I'm afraid.
1	action	end
1	cond	With the fingernails
2	line	Player	Have a look at these...
2	line	Watchtower Wizard	Interesting, very interesting.
2	line	Watchtower Wizard	Long nails...grey in colour...well chewed...
2	line	Watchtower Wizard	Of course! They belong to a skavid!
2	line	Player	A skavid?
2	line	Watchtower Wizard	A servant race to the ogres: grey, depressed-looking creatures, always losing nails, teeth and hair!
2	line	Watchtower Wizard	They inhabit the caves in the Feldip Hills.
2	line	Watchtower Wizard	They normally keep to themselves, though. It's unusual for them to venture from their caves.
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	What do you suggest I do?
3	line	Player	What do you suggest I do?
3	line	Watchtower Wizard	It's no good searching the caves. Well, not yet, anyway.
3	line	Player	Why not?
3	line	Watchtower Wizard	They are deep and complex. The only way you will navigate the caves is to have a map or something.
3	line	Watchtower Wizard	It may be that the ogres have one...
3	line	Player	And how do you know that?
3	line	Watchtower Wizard	Well... I don't.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	So what do I do?
4	line	Player	So what do I do?
4	line	Watchtower Wizard	You need to be fearless and gain entrance to Gu'Tanoth, the city of the ogres, then find out how to navigate the caves.
4	line	Player	That sounds scary...
4	line	Watchtower Wizard	Ogres are nasty creatures, yes. Only a strong warrior, and a clever one at that, can get the better of them.
4	line	Player	What do I need to do to get into the city?
4	line	Watchtower Wizard	You'll need some way to make the guards let you in.
4	line	Watchtower Wizard	You could start by checking out the ogre settlements around here. Tribal ogres often dislike their neighbours... In the meantime, I'll throw those fingernails out for you.
4	action	end
3	option	I won't bother then.
4	line	Player	I won't bother, then.
4	line	Watchtower Wizard	Won't bother? Won't bother!
4	line	Watchtower Wizard	Perhaps this quest is too hard for you?
4	action	end
2	option	Shall I search the caves?
3	line	Player	Shall I search the caves?
