0	section	East gate guard
1	cond	The first time:
2	line	Ogre guard	Halt! You cannot pass here.
2	line	Player	I am a friend to ogres.
2	line	Ogre guard	You will be my friend only with gold. Bring me a bar of pure gold and I will let you pass.
2	action	end
1	cond	Afterwards, without a gold bar:
2	line	Ogre guard	Creature, did you bring me the gold?
2	line	Player	No, I don't have it.
2	line	Ogre guard	No gold, no passage. Get out of this city!
2	box	The guard pushes you back down the hill.
2	action	(The ogre guard pushes you back down the hill, stunning you and dealing 3 damage)
2	action	end
1	cond	Afterwards, with a gold bar:
2	line	Ogre guard	Creature, did you bring me the gold?
2	line	Player	Here it is!
2	line	Ogre guard	It's brought it! On your way.
2	action	(The gate opens and the player walks through)
2	action	end
1	cond	After giving him the gold:
2	line	Ogre guard	I know you, creature; you may pass.
2	action	end
