2	line	City guard	Is that so... You humour me small t'ing. Answer this riddle and I will help you...
2	line	City guard	I want you to bring me an item: I will give you all the letters of this item, you work out what it is...
2	line	City guard	My first is in days, but not in years, My second is in evil, and also in tears, My third is in all, but not in none, My fourth is in hot, but not in sun.
2	line	City guard	My fifth is in heaven, and also in hate, My sixth is in fearing, but not in fate, My seventh is in plush, but not in place.
2	line	City guard	My eighth is in nine, but not in eight, My last is in earth, and also in great.
2	line	City guard	My whole is an object, that magic will make. It brings wrack and ruin to all in its wake... Now how long, I wonder, will this riddle take?
2	action	end
