0	section	Talking to the Watchtower Wizard after discovering the shamans are invincible
1	line	Player	I have found the cave of ogre shaman, but I cannot touch them!
1	line	Watchtower Wizard	That is because of their magical powers. We must fight them with their own methods; do not speak to them! I suggest a potion...
1	line	Watchtower Wizard	Collect a guam leaf, add jangerberries, then mix in some ground bat bones. You must return it to me before you use it, so that I can empower it with my magic.
1	line	Watchtower Wizard	Be very careful how you mix it as it is extremely volatile. Mixing ingredients of this type in the wrong order can cause explosions!
1	line	Watchtower Wizard	I hope you've been brushing up Herblore and Magic? I must warn you, only experienced magicians can use the potion. It is too dangerous in the hands of the unskilled.
1	action	end
